, or W6**: Breaks the character sequence\n\nReason:\nT8 is a dead tile because T7 and T9 are completely exhausted (0 remaining). Keeping T8-T8 pair provides no winning potential. By discarding T8, I maintain maximum flexibility with the W4-W5-W6 sequence and B5-B6 combination. This keeps my hand alive for potential draws that could complete a winning pattern.\n\nAnswer: Play T8"}
